Testing confirms this.  I ate until satiated, then waited until the
satiation ended (999 nutrition at that point).  Then based on the
number of turns it took to reach each of {hungry, weak, fainting,
dead}, I calculated the nutrition loss per turn. It was always
0.05 +/- 0.001.  And 1 nutrition per 20 turns is just the amulet
hunger. (The variation is presumably due to when the counter is
updated)




